  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3517 provides an overview of inter-cloud trust management by specifying isolation and security management mechanisms, inter-cloud trust management model, reputation-based trust management in an inter-cloud environment, cloud service evaluation framework and the relationship with cloud computing reference architecture. It also provides requirements for inter-cloud trust management derived from the corresponding use cases.</abstract>
